    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Not now!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не зараз!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Ya here to do business? ::He says from behind a long, large-caliber barrel.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви тут для ведення справ? ::Він каже з-за довгої, великокаліберної труби.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a4" name="=&gt;a4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Nod.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Кивок.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Then pass. He's over by the shack.

::He steps aside.::

I'm watching you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тоді проходьте. Він біля халупи.

::Він відступає вбік.::

Я спостерігаю за вами.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a6" name="=&gt;a6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm here to do business alright.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я тут, щоб зайнятися справами.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a7" name="=&gt;a7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Business? What kind of business?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Справа? Яка справа?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I suggest ya get $(#lost, jack/yer pretty tushie outta here). ::He signals you away with his rifle.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я раджу вам $(#lost, jack/швидко забратися звідси). ::Він жестом показує вам рукою, щоб ви пішли, використовуючи свою гвинтівку.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a9" name="=&gt;a9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Not really.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не зовсім.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Then &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тоді.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a11" name="=&gt;a11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Whoops, wrong place. I'll get going now.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ой, не те місце. Я йду звідси зараз.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a12" name="=&gt;a12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Killing is my business... and business is good! ::Attack!::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Вбивство – це моя робота... і бізнес іде добре! ::Атака!::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>You again.

Here to do business?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Знову ти.

Прийшов для бізнесу?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Gestures that he's watching you.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Жестикулює, показуючи, що стежить за вами.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
